<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>AI Research Review</title><link>https://jaehun.me/tags/ai-research-review/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/tags/ai-research-review/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Accelerated Test-Time Scaling with Model-Free Speculative Sampling</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/accelerated-test-time-scaling-with-model-free-speculative-sampling/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/accelerated-test-time-scaling-with-model-free-speculative-sampling/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.04708v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="한-줄-요약-tldr"&gt;한 줄 요약 (TL;DR)&lt;a href="#%ed%95%9c-%ec%a4%84-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd-tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;STAND (STochastic Adaptive N-gram Drafting)&lt;/code&gt;은 &lt;strong&gt;추가 학습이나 별도 드래프트 모델 없이&lt;/strong&gt;도 대규모 LLM의 테스트-타임 스케일링(Test-Time Scaling)을 가속한다. 표준 오토리그레시브 디코딩 대비 &lt;strong&gt;추론 지연을 60 ~ 65 % 줄이고 처리량을 14 ~ 28 % 높이며 정확도는 유지&lt;/strong&gt;한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>